## Responsive strategy

One page, not two frames. Tailwind breakpoints match Figma deltas:

- `md+`: section centered, 2-col grid, py-10 px-6
- `<md`: section top-aligned, 1-col grid, p-6

## Motion

- Entrance: GSAP `useGSAP` in `src/lib/gsap/useEntranceAnimation.ts`
- Link hover: CSS transitions only (interruptible UI)
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
